From 7ad8bdd02ff6f886f81a9cc9e351faa5e056bbd3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 8 Jun 2026 09:55:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Apply deck-based rebrand: cyan+lime palette, real logo,
 footer updates
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Recolor entire site from teal+amber to cyan (#08AEEA) + lime (#C4DC6A),
  matching the Pitch Deck v0.1 palette. CSS aliases keep backward compat.
- Add UNA logo mark images to public/images/logo/; replace text "UNA" in
  nav and footer with the real una-mark-light.png wordmark.
- Footer: update LinkedIn → linkedin.com/company/una-energy/ and
  X → x.com/UNA_ENERGY; restructure Dane rejestrowe to flat layout
  with document icon, bold company name, and aligned label/value rows.
- MediaSection: remove "Baza wiedzy" tab; retitle section to
  "Publikacje i media"; tabs are now Publikacje / W mediach / Newsletter.
- AuraCanvas: update WebGL shader color uniforms to cyan+lime.
- All 16 source files pass TypeScript (tsc --noEmit --skipLibCheck).

https://claude.ai/code/session_01QNpnF3z4ZDayyhKxXWYuvr
